# PostgreSQL — Estándares y patrones

## Nomenclatura

```sql
-- Tablas: snake_case, plural
CREATE TABLE public.user_profiles (...);

-- Columnas estándar en TODA tabla
id          uuid        DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,
created_at  timestamptz DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,
updated_at  timestamptz DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,

-- FKs: [tabla_referenciada]_id
user_id     uuid REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE NOT NULL,
```

## Triggers obligatorios

```sql
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.handle_updated_at()
RETURNS TRIGGER AS $$
BEGIN
  NEW.updated_at = now();
  RETURN NEW;
END;
$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;

CREATE TRIGGER set_updated_at
  BEFORE UPDATE ON public.[table_name]
  FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION public.handle_updated_at();
```

## Row Level Security — NO NEGOCIABLE

```sql
ALTER TABLE public.[table_name] ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;

CREATE POLICY "users_own_data" ON public.[table_name]
  FOR ALL
  USING (auth.uid() = user_id)
  WITH CHECK (auth.uid() = user_id);

CREATE POLICY "module_access" ON public.[table_name]
  FOR SELECT
  USING (
    EXISTS (
      SELECT 1 FROM public.user_module_permissions
      WHERE user_id = auth.uid()
        AND module_name = '[module]'
        AND can_read = true
    )
  );
```

## Índices estratégicos

```sql
CREATE INDEX idx_[table]_user_id ON public.[table](user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_[table]_created_at ON public.[table](created_at DESC);

CREATE INDEX idx_[table]_[col]_trgm ON public.[table]
  USING GIN ([column] gin_trgm_ops);

CREATE INDEX idx_[table]_active ON public.[table](user_id)
  WHERE status = 'active';
```

## Migraciones

- Archivo: `supabase/migrations/YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_descripcion.sql`
- Incluir comentario de qué hace la migración
- Nunca `DROP` sin `IF EXISTS`
- Preferir migraciones idempotentes

```sql
-- Migration: Add module_permissions table
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS public.module_permissions (
  id          uuid        DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,
  user_id     uuid        REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE NOT NULL,
  module_name text        NOT NULL,
  can_read    boolean     DEFAULT false NOT NULL,
  can_write   boolean     DEFAULT false NOT NULL,
  can_delete  boolean     DEFAULT false NOT NULL,
  created_at  timestamptz DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,
  updated_at  timestamptz DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,
  UNIQUE(user_id, module_name)
);

ALTER TABLE public.module_permissions ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
```
